Build-Depends: ${DEBIAN_BUILD_DEPENDS}

Package: visionfive2-memlat-tools
Architecture: ${DISTRO_ARCH}
Description: ${DESCRIPTION}
 visionfive2-memlat-tools runs the memory-contention experiments
 (visionfive2-memlat-tools -l lists them).
 memlat-dist and memlat-probe time dependent loads, aggr generates memory
 traffic with controlled locality and rate, and memreg is a polling
 bandwidth regulator. pfctl, waymask and l2pmu access the L2 prefetchers,
 the L2 way masks and the L2 event counters of the SiFive U74-MC through
 /dev/mem and only work on the JH7110.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, stress-ng, rt-tests, isolbench, python3
